#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: magic-linking.php
msgid "Magic Linking – Internal Links"
msgstr "Magic Linking – Internal Links"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: magic-linking.php
msgid "https://magiclinking.com"
msgstr "https://magiclinking.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: magic-linking.php
msgid "Internal link suggestions in the editor. Link in one click, check that nothing else changes, undo from History. Plus orphan and broken link reports."
msgstr "Sugestões de links internos no editor. Vincule com um clique, confira que nada mais muda e desfaça pelo Histórico. Além disso, relatórios de conteúdos órfãos e de links quebrados."

